# Claude Code's scratch worktrees. These are working copies of THIS repository —
# committing one records a gitlink to a commit that exists only in somebody's
# local clone, which is how .claude/worktrees/issue-33-closeout got in (2eef761)
# and dangled until it was removed. Editor/agent state is not repository state.
#
# Scoped to worktrees/ rather than all of .claude/ on purpose: shared agent
# config (settings.json, agents, skills) is a reasonable thing to commit later,
# and a blanket ignore would silently swallow it.
/.claude/worktrees/
